# Goal Description
Migrate the existing React-based User Interface ([App.jsx](file:///d:/Projects/impressioncore/src/interfaces/web_client/src/App.jsx)) to a high-performance, native desktop application using **Dear PyGui**. The new application will replicate the futuristic "Chat Interface", "Vision Controls", and "System Status" panels, while maintaining connection to the existing `triad_api` backend for logic and device control.

# User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Architecture Decision**: The Dear PyGui application will act as a **Client**, connecting to the existing `triad_api` (FastAPI) running on `localhost:8000`. This ensures existing backend logic ([OrbCloudVision](file:///d:/Projects/impressioncore/src/orchestrator/orbcloud_vision.py#84-895), `UnifiedBrainTriad`) remains untouched and stable.
>
> **Video Streaming**: Video feeds will be consumed via the existing MJPEG stream (`/v1/vision/stream`) to avoid hardware conflict (as the backend "owns" the camera connection).

# Visual Migration Strategy

## Color Palette (Tailwind Translation)
We will replicate the "Cyberpunk/Sci-Fi" aesthetic by mapping the existing Tailwind colors to Dear PyGui theme variables.

| Role | Tailwind Class | Hex Code | DPG Target |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Window Bg** | `bg-slate-900` | `#0f172a` | `mvThemeCol_WindowBg` |
| **Panel Bg** | `bg-black/40` | `#000000` (Alpha 100) | `mvThemeCol_ChildBg` |
| **Primary Text** | `text-slate-300` | `#cbd5e1` | `mvThemeCol_Text` |
| **Accent (Main)** | `text-cyan-400` | `#22d3ee` | `mvThemeCol_Button`, `mvThemeCol_Border` |
| **Accent (Active)** | `text-cyan-300` | `#67e8f9` | `mvThemeCol_ButtonActive` |
| **Status (Green)** | `text-green-500` | `#22c55e` | Custom Indicator Color |
| **Status (Red)** | `text-red-500` | `#ef4444` | Custom Indicator Color |

## Typography
- **Monospace Font**: The key to the "Technical" look is a clean monospace font (like `JetBrains Mono` or `Consolas`).
- **Implementation**: We will load a `.ttf` file using `dpg.add_font()` and apply it globally to match the `font-mono` look of the React app.

## Layout Structure
- **Flexbox Emulation**: DPG uses `add_group(horizontal=True)` to create row-based layouts.
- **Responsive**: We will use `dpg.set_primary_window()` to ensure the main container resizes with the OS window, mimicking the web app's responsiveness.
- **Glassmorphism**: While true separate-layer blur is hard in standard DPG, we will use semi-transparent backgrounds (`alpha=200`) on child windows to simulate the depth of `backdrop-blur`.

# Proposed Changes


## New Directory: `src/interfaces/dpg_client/`

### [NEW] `src/interfaces/dpg_client/main.py`
Entry point for the application. Sets up the DPG context, viewport, and main loop.

### [NEW] `src/interfaces/dpg_client/ui/style.py`
Defines the "ImpressionCore" theme:
- Custom colors (`slate-900` equivalent, `cyan-400` accents).
- Rounded styling (where supported) and font configuration.

### [NEW] `src/interfaces/dpg_client/components/chat_panel.py`
Replicates the Chat Interface:
- Scrolling message history.
- Input field with "Send" button.
- **Voice Integration**:
    - Uses `src.orchestrator.orbcloud_audio.OrbCloudAudio` for STT.
    - Implements a "Hold to Speak" or "Toggle" button that triggers [start_listening](file:///d:/Projects/impressioncore/src/orchestrator/orbcloud_audio.py#78-154) / [stop_listening](file:///d:/Projects/impressioncore/src/orchestrator/orbcloud_audio.py#202-207).
    - Routes transcribed text into the chat input field.
    - Uses `ffplay` (via `orbcloud_audio.play_file`) or `playsound` for TTS output.

### [NEW] `src/interfaces/dpg_client/components/vision_panel.py`
Replicates Vision Controls & Telemetry:
- **Video Display**: A DPG Image item updated 30fps from the backend stream.
- **Controls**: Sliders for Brightness, Contrast, Saturation.
- **Telemetry**: Real-time text/graphs for X/Y/Z tracking data.

### [NEW] `src/interfaces/dpg_client/components/system_status.py`
Replicates the System Status Overlay:
- Health indicators (Green/Yellow/Red) for Vision, Intelligence, Sensory.
- VRAM usage progress bar.

### [NEW] `src/interfaces/dpg_client/async_utils.py`
Helper for running async API calls (requests/axios equivalent) without blocking the DPG GUI thread.

# Verification Plan

## Automated Tests
- None (GUI testing is manual).

## Manual Verification
1.  **Start Backend**: Run [src/interfaces/triad_api.py](file:///d:/Projects/impressioncore/src/interfaces/triad_api.py).
2.  **Start Client**: Run `src/interfaces/dpg_client/main.py`.
3.  **Verify UI**:
    -   Check if the **Theme** matches the "tech/dark" aesthetic.
    -   Confirm **System Status** loads and shows "Active"/"Nominal".
4.  **Verify Chat**:
    -   Type a message "Hello", ensure it appears in the chat log and receives a response from the backend.
5.  **Verify Vision**:
    -   Check if the **Video Feed** is visible and updating.
    -   Adjust **Sliders** (Brightness) and verify the video feed changes.
    -   Verify **Telemetry** numbers update when moving in front of the camera.
